      "writtenOn": "2021-01-22T17:55:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This fails with the error you predicted in the ub-launcher3-master presubmit tests. Presumably for the reason you suggested at line 424 in dexpreopt_bootjars.go.\n\nI don\u0027t quite understand why as the code should only fail if the dex2oat module cannot be found as a dependency given that a dependency is added in the DepsMutator() of the singleton. I\u0027ll take a look at that next week.",
      "parentUuid": "94b1e9ac_ee8b99e1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "c8f58143c74c027e5d6ad3b8aad3e74071d23241",
