      "writtenOn": "2021-01-25T11:44:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I cannot make TARGET_BUILD_APPS\u003d... disable boot images, as this was the whole point of the recent change aosp/1555134: we build mainline modules with TARGET_BUILD_APPS\u003d\u003clist of modules\u003e, and we need boot images to be enabled for that build.\n\nFrom a local discussion with Martin I understand that you intend to solve this problem by moving the blueprint definition of boot image to ART repo, right?",
      "parentUuid": "0e3beb67_3a47442d",
      "range": {
